            "politeness": "polite"
          },
          {
            "who": "中村",
            "text": "{人|ひと}{は|wa}{多|おお}かったですか。",
            "meaning": "Were there a lot of people?",
            "politeness": "polite"
          },
          {
            "who": "レオ",
            "text": "はい、{多|おお}かったです。{静|しず}かじゃありませんでした。",
            "meaning": "Yes, there were. It wasn't quiet.",
            "politeness": "polite"
          },
          {
            "who": "中村",
            "text": "{食|た}べ{物|もの}{は|wa}？",
            "meaning": "And the food?",
            "politeness": "polite"
          },
          {
            "who": "レオ",
            "text": "おいしかったです。でも、{安|やす}くなかったです。",
            "meaning": "It was delicious. But it wasn't cheap.",
            "politeness": "polite"
          }
        ],
        "notes": [
          {
            "title": "い-adjectives in the past",
